      "en": "I, even I, have spoken. Yes, I have called him. I have brought him and he shall make his way prosperous.",
      "ko": "나 곧 내가 말하였고 또 내가 그를 부르며 그를 인도하였나니 그 길이 형통하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "546799dbcae1b90adfe040912436f4838e85c747804c88ddc57b0e60bb7d7dfd",
